off are held for the following month's run.\",\"line\":9,\"span\":\"Submissions that\\narrive after the cut-off are held for the following month's run.\"},{\"text\":\"If the 20th falls on a weekend, the cut-off moves to the following Monday.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"If the 20th falls on a weekend, the cut-off moves to the following Monday.\"},{\"text\":\"One file per team should be submitted.\",\"line\":16,\"span\":\"Submit one file per team listing every hourly worker with hours and the cost\\ncentre the hours are charged to.\"},{\"text\":\"The submitted file lists every hourly worker with hours.\",\"line\":16,\"span\":\"Submit one file per team listing every hourly worker with hours and the cost\\ncentre the hours are charged to.\"},{\"text\":\"The submitted file lists the cost centre the hours are charged to.\",\"line\":16,\"span\":\"Submit one file per team listing every hourly worker with hours and the cost\\ncentre the hours are charged to.\"},{\"text\":\"A correction submitted before the cut-off replaces the earlier file entirely.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"A correction submitted before the cut-off replaces the earlier file entirely.\"},{\"text\":\"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request.\"},{\"text\":\"Teams without terminal access may send paper timesheets to the payroll office by internal post.\",\"line\":26,\"span\":\"Teams without terminal access may send paper timesheets to the payroll office by\\ninternal post, to arrive no later than the cut-off.\"},{\"text\":\"Paper timesheets sent by internal post must arrive no later than the cut-off.\",\"line\":26,\"span\":\"Teams without terminal access may send paper timesheets to the payroll office by\\ninternal post, to arrive no later than the cut-off.\"}]}","ttft_ms":6597,"type":"result","duration_ms":6633,"uuid":"ff47914f-8741-4255-9b30-102f2c7b3ae9","ttft_stream_ms":1422,"